nd wears skimpy clothes, and is silly and funny. The yakuza is after him but he still lives very carefree and unbothered.\n\nPlease draw Hiharu laying down in the back seat of a car, asleep. He is tied up by the yakuza but is sleeping shamelessly without a care in the world. He is even drooling. Please make it very sexy, cool and a little funny!\n\nPlease choose me, I love your art style and I think it suits Hiharu. I like the BL style more than shoujo. \n\nThank you! ♡\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1rOYlbQigFTXFinl9Z6JO4Wfg_Wbtfaqn?usp=sharing", "nc": 136, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kznr_ff/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1679682, "client_id": 1316301, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/750baf95/uploads/origins/134fdb1a-816f-4e8c-a4a7-aa936008d9e0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dfc76e357b394c5cedb6967daaa0de1e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/750baf95/uploads/origins/134fdb1a-816f-4e8c-a4a7-aa936008d9e0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dfc76e357b394c5cedb6967daaa0de1e, https://si.imgix.net/750baf95/uploads/origins/134fdb1a-816f-4e8c-a4a7-aa936008d9e0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d2ce9c3e6062b9b1da9684c0b58883e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/750baf95/uploads/origins/134fdb1a-816f-4e8c-a4a7-aa936008d9e0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1b1d3d34b98b761c188346706410a5c3 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/750baf95/uploads/origins/134fdb1a-816f-4e8c-a4a7-aa936008d9e0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0e566ecc46bb4c9fb304083c94aea66e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/750baf95/uplo